# Jars (glob patterns) moved to server/mods-excluded/ for the dh-next profile, one per line.
# Every exclusion is recorded in the smoke report.
#
# Chunky 1.4.23 with Distant Horizons 3.3.3: the server crashes while it prepares the spawn chunks,
# "IllegalStateException: Chunky is not loaded" from org.popcraft.chunky.ChunkyProvider.get, called
# by Distant Horizons' own ChunkyAccessor.bindOnGenerationProgressEvent in its chunk-load listener
# (2026-10-01, smoke dh-next; Distant Horizons 3.3.3's Chunky hook runs before Chunky has started).
# The dh profile (Distant Horizons 3.3.0) boots with Chunky. The MIC pack pins both, so a Distant
# Horizons update there has this to settle too.
Chunky-*.jar
